{"unit_id":"MYCF711__dsh-session-superagent#card-zh","repo":"MYCF711/dsh-session-superagent","commit":"25d8473cc469d88c8896e3d2c2484f05695af043","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-superagent（主理鱼）是 DSH Web 插件，可按会话监视 GitHub 与 Gitee 的 issue 和 PR，并在有新动态时唤醒对应会话。它支持过滤、活跃时段、隔离 worktree、唤醒限额和处理确认，可回写标签或评论。浏览器面板用于查看、配置 watcher 和诊断状态；另提供 GitHub API 与当前仓库查询工具。GitHub 可用 gh CLI 或面板 token；私有 Gitee 和写回需要令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2997","lib/index.js:2955","client.js:3490","lib/gitee.js:14","lib/index.js:2255"]}
